  "body": "Refs #45\n\n## Changes\n\n- Animate floating label ink with Material Fast Effects in Outlined and Filled text fields.\n- Retarget ink on focus and validation. Apply the new palette immediately after a theme change. Keep the editor and label positions stable.\n- Clear the disabled color track. The first enabled frame uses enabled ink.\n- Wait for the focused frame in the compact browser test before advancing its clock.\n\n## Verification\n\n- The tested PR source tree is `9d3ce235f8efde1459fd41862cd918367fc85207`. The one-file test change uses the same product source bytes as the checked Gallery and Web builds.\n- 1,575 Rust tests and three WebAssembly checks passed. Apple Metal ran 18 offscreen tests.\n- Two native headless replays produced 14 matching PNGs through Page.screenshot, CLI and MCP.\n- Five headless macOS suites passed 25,276 checks including 349 Material steps. All four compact M350 probes read the expected 44 ms color. The window guard found zero visible windows and no remaining processes.\n- The baseline fails the new first-frame ink assertion. All 13 focused field tests pass with the fix.\n\n[First-frame regression and corrected product source](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/7541bb6474e536945643b84badd84c604a4859fd/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-label-color-v0168-enable-contrast)\n\n[Headless commands, program results, and original PNGs](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/eb3ec0e842340bfc5846d543324a1d0dc1f03444/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-label-color-v0168-corrected-runtime)\n",
  "changed_files": 10,
